  --logs-level <logs-level>
                          Log level for --logs: default, info, debug. Defaults
                          to `default`. iOS passes it to `log stream --level`;
                          on Android default and info keep logcat priority I
                          and above, debug adds D. (values: default, info,
114:`--logs-level` maps to a minimum logcat priority, for the tag or for every tag:
116:| `--logs-level`      | logcat filter |
118:| (none) or `default` | `*:I`         |
119:| `info`              | `*:I`         |
120:| `debug`             | `*:D`         |
